## Dive Mode

If the user types `/dive [lens]` after seeing the report:

- **`/dive visual`** → detailed design-engineer review with before/after table and code fixes
- **`/dive animation`** → run `/animate-this` workflow on the flagged elements
- **`/dive performance`** → detailed performance investigation with code changes
- **`/dive locale`** → fix each locale issue one by one with code changes
- **`/dive accessibility`** → fix each a11y issue with code changes and ARIA additions

---

## Meta Rules

- Report issues only — don't narrate things that are correct.
- Severity must be honest: 🔴 = blocks shipping, 🟡 = should fix soon, 🟢 = nice to have.
- Summary comes before details — always lead with "ship-ready / minor issues / needs work".
- Save report to `~/.designeros/projects/<name>/audit-report.md`
